OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran, 102, meets grandson
OL,4,Aof WW2 commander
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the last surviving D-Day
OL,7,Fveterans has met the grandson of the
OL,8,Flegendary WW2 commander Field Marshal
OL,9,FBernard Montgomery.
OL,11,FRichard Brock, 102, from Lancaster,
OL,12,Fvisited a defence firm in Stockport,
OL,13,Fwhere the Boxer armoured vehicle is
OL,14,Fbuilt, and met Henry Montgomery, 3rd
OL,15,FViscount Montgomery of Alamein.
OL,17,FBrock landed on Gold beach in June 1944
OL,18,Fand is now believed to be the last
OL,19,Fremaining member of the East Lancashire
OL,20,FRegiment.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
