OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1794160543
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran, 102, meets grandson
OL,4,Aof WW2 commander
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The landing of course was horrendous
OL,7,Fand your heart was beating because your
OL,8,Fmates were being popped off but we
OL,9,Fmanaged to advance towards Hill 112
OL,10,Fnear Caen," he said.
